      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹45.99 (vs ₹31.72 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹45.99 (up from ₹31.72 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹9.83b (up 15% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹177.7m (up 45% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.8% (up from 1.4% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 17% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
